docs {
  # Accept Friend Request (`AcceptFriendship`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.AcceptFriendship` in [friendship_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/friendship_handler.go)
  **Route**: `POST /api/_private/v1/friendships/accept/:friendId` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Accepts an incoming pending friendship invite:
  - Locates the pending request where `user_id = currentUserId` (receiver) and `friend_id = friendId` (sender).
  - Updates the status to `"ACCEPTED"`.
  - Dispatches WebSocket event `FRIEND_REQUEST_ACCEPTED` to both users so UIs update synchronously.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `friendId` (string, path parameter): User ID of the person who originally sent the invite.
}
